<title>NEW ZEALAND: Spectrum details nickel tests in Vietnam.</title>
<headline>Spectrum details nickel tests in Vietnam.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand and Canadian-listed Spectrum Resources Ltd said on Friday results from parts of its second drilling programme at its Ta Khoa concession in Vietnam had exceeded management expectations by showing continued high grade nickel.</p>
<p>Spectrum said the results were now available from five of 16 test holes of about 2000 metres in depth which it is drilling at Ban Phuc.</p>
</text>
